{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\widowctrl\hyphauto
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \b \fs36 ReaSmoothPlayhead\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Replaces REAPER's choppy native play cursor with a GPU-smooth playhead overlay, in the arrange view and the MIDI editor. Customizable line, trail, shadow and visual FX, with presets.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \b Windows, macOS, and Linux (0.2.7+).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The settings window REQUIRES ReaImGui (install "ReaImGui: ReaScript binding for Dear ImGui" via ReaPack); the overlay itself works without it.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 After install, restart REAPER. Settings: Extensions > Smooth playhead.\par}
}

